the move move with a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    a role is a control at the time
    and the role movable the thing with the second thing at the time.

a player movable a thing with a second thing at a time if
    the thing is the cell of the player at the time
    and the player car the thing with a third thing
    and it is not the case that the third thing is the cell of blank at the time
    and the player car the third thing with a fourth thing
    and the fourth thing is the cell of blank at the time
    and the player car the fourth thing with a fifth thing
    and it is not the case that the fifth thing is the cell of blank at the time
    and the player car the fifth thing with the second thing
    and the second thing is the cell of blank at the time.

