the goal of red is a number at a time if
    h1 is the cell of a role at the time
    and h2 is the cell of a second role at the time
    and i1 is the cell of a third role at the time
    and the role count the second role with the third role with red with the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    13 is a step at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and the goal of a role is 100 at the time.

when the move move with a thing and a second thing is made
    and a role is a control
then the thing is the cell of blank
    and the second thing is the cell of the role
    and it is not the case that the thing is the cell of the role
    and it is not the case that the second thing is the cell of blank.

when the move move with a thing and a second thing is made
    and a third thing is a step
    and the succ of the third thing is a fourth thing
then the fourth thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the third thing is a step.

when the move noop is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the thing and the second thing is legal.

